# Only what `cargo build -p kvm-rdp -p kvm-probe` reads (Plan E Task 4.1).
# An allowlist: captures/, .superpowers/, target/, spikes/ never enter the
# build context.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!.cargo/config.toml
!crates/
!fixtures/slate_1080p.h264
# .gitignore's patterns inside crates/: image-build.sh's `git status` check
# cannot see them, so they are kept out here (PE10 review m5).
crates/**/target
crates/**/debug
crates/**/mutants.out*
crates/**/*.rs.bk
